b_T(a){return"Reset "+a},
gb_Q(){return"From the time and elevation of your rides (recordings and those taken over via GPX import): for each ride the climbs of at least 100 m in one go, classified by the ways in your stored areas, the median per way class from three climbs on. Never from other people\u2019s rides; nothing leaves the device."},
