gaYX(){return"When a buddy reports something on a trail you can see (confirmed, i.e. on site or ridden), writes a note or sends you a message. Applies to this device only. The notification shows the trail name, the buddy\u2019s name and what they report (for a note or a message, the text) \u2014 never a location. It goes through Google."},
